WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.930 --> 00:00:08.250
The USA is obligated by treaty to go to war
for 67 different countries if they were to

00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:15.320
find themselves in conflict.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:21.150
The very first assassination attempt on a
US president was stopped when the then president,

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:26.930
Andrew Jackson, beat his assailant brutally
with a cane before being stopped by a nearby

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:28.880
congressman.

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:33.800
Mongooses were introduced to Hawaii to control
the invasive rat population.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:38.960
However, rats are nocturnal and mongooses
are diurnal.

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:42.660
Hawaii now has a problem with both.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:50.730
Spain cheated in the 2000 Summer Paralympics.
10 of the 12 players on their roster “were

00:00:50.730 --> 00:00:56.940
encouraged to pretend to be stupid” and
had no mental disability.

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:02.989
A man named Adam Armstrong changed his name
to Adam West by deed poll to match his misprinted

00:01:02.989 --> 00:01:07.330
airline ticket as it was cheaper than paying
the airline's admin fee.

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:13.570
A child that was Bart's age when The Simpsons
first premiered, would now be the same age

00:01:13.570 --> 00:01:15.360
as Homer.

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:19.720
Higher intelligence is linked with higher
rates of mental illness such as schizophrenia

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:26.650
and bipolar disorder, causing the “mad scientist”
stereotype to have ground in reality.

00:01:26.650 --> 00:01:32.200
Surgical masks in Japan are not only used
to prevent sickness but are used for fashion,

00:01:32.200 --> 00:01:36.760
warmth, and sometimes avoiding conversations
with strangers.

00:01:36.760 --> 00:01:42.799
Englishman Frank Bickerton fought in both
world wars, was drafted into two Antarctic

00:01:42.799 --> 00:01:49.270
expeditions, developed a golf course, was
the hero of a novel, killed bears, wrote major

00:01:49.270 --> 00:01:55.850
motion pictures, treasure hunted in Costa
Rica and married an earl's granddaughter.

00:01:55.850 --> 00:02:01.640
There's a strange phenomenon in the film industry
called “Twin Movies” where eerily similar

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:06.119
movies get released around the same time and
not on purpose.

00:02:06.119 --> 00:02:12.700
For example, The Prestige and The Illusionist,
Antz and A Bug's Life, Olympus Has Fallen

00:02:12.700 --> 00:02:17.980
and White House Down, Friends With Benefits
and No Strings Attached.

00:02:17.980 --> 00:02:23.379
Door knobs made out of brass automatically
disinfect themselves in about 8 hours through

00:02:23.379 --> 00:02:26.120
the oligodynamic effect.

00:02:26.120 --> 00:02:32.260
The gaping holes that buildings in Hong Kong
usually have are called dragon windows or

00:02:32.260 --> 00:02:33.620
dragon holes.

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:39.239
They are put into building so they don't block
dragons' passage from the hills to the sea.

00:02:39.239 --> 00:02:45.150
Underneath the striped fur of a tiger is striped
skin, which helps preserves the camouflage

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:46.150
effect.

00:02:46.150 --> 00:02:53.859
Mark Spitz, nine time Olympic champion, jokingly
told the Russian swim team coach in 1972 that

00:02:53.859 --> 00:02:59.469
his moustache increased his speed in the water,
deflecting water away from his mouth.

00:02:59.469 --> 00:03:03.379
The next year, every Russian swimmer was sporting
one.

00:03:03.379 --> 00:03:11.120
In 1982, Universal Studios sued Nintendo over
alleged similarities between King Kong and

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.430
Donkey Kong.

00:03:12.430 --> 00:03:18.969
Not only did Universal lose, but the court
found a King Kong game licensed by Universal

00:03:18.969 --> 00:03:23.980
was actually in violation of Nintendo's copyrights.

00:03:23.980 --> 00:03:29.150
Franklin D. Roosevelt once accidentally walked
in on a naked Winston Churchill.

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:34.229
When Roosevelt apologised, Churchill replied
“The Prime Minister of Great Britain has

00:03:34.229 --> 00:03:40.419
nothing to hide from the President of the
United States”.

